        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Projection Style Short Throw Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4070 Short Throw Deadbolt provides security for a conventionally projected bolt in installations where the longthrow MS® Deadlock cannot be used. The smaller 4070 deadbolt offers the longest practical throw from a narrow stile. 180° turn of key or thumbturn projects or retracts the bolt. Lock accepts any standard1\" [25.4 mm] length, 1-5/32\" [29.4 mm] diameter mortise cylinder or thumbturn with special cam dimensions. Lock accepts cylinder from either or both sides.  Individually boxed with machine screws for mounting. Cylinder and/or thumbturn available separately.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Adams Rite 4070-20-628 Mortise Short Throw Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 7/8\", 31/32\", or 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Width: 1\" </li>\r\n<li>Case Height: 6\" </li>\r\n<li>Case Depth: Varies by Backset </li>\r\n<li>Bolt Dimensions: 5/8\" x 1-1/4\" \r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 5-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Individually boxed with machine\r\nscrews for mounting. Cylinder and/\r\nor thumbturn available separately.\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ADA-4070-specifications.pdf?v=1718159598\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Mortise Short Throw Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
